clump keys (? or esc to close)

Navigate
  j/k    next/previous group
  enter  focus the diff pane
  ]/[    next/previous group from anywhere
  a      grouped / all hunks

Search
  /    search
  n/N  next/previous match

Edit
  x         mark hunk
  M         move marked hunks
  R         rename group
  u/ctrl+r  undo/redo